{"id":"6e56db0129607b23","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-rosser-incompleteness.md","title":"Rosser's Incompleteness Theorem","display":"thm-rosser-incompleteness — Rosser's Incompleteness Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-rosser-incompleteness","aliases":["92-thm-rosser-incompleteness"],"display":"thm-rosser-incompleteness — Rosser's Incompleteness Theorem","depends_on":["[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-rosser-sentence]]","[[92-df-consistent]]","[[92-df-elementary-system]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-axiom-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-rosser-incompleteness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-rosser-incompleteness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-rosser-incompleteness — Rosser's Incompleteness Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9252d4105cc5f189\" href=\"?note=9252d4105cc5f189\" title=\"92-df-rosser-sentence\">92-df-rosser-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"360e00ddf38f0f16\" href=\"?note=360e00ddf38f0f16\" title=\"92-df-elementary-system\">92-df-elementary-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"35c764f4e9f21f28\" href=\"?note=35c764f4e9f21f28\" title=\"92-df-axiom-set\">92-df-axiom-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span> (consistency, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span> (effectivity and arithmetic-strength conditions)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RosserSent}_G(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{RosserSent}_G(R)\\)</span> (Rosser-sentence predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"9252d4105cc5f189\" href=\"?note=9252d4105cc5f189\" title=\"92-df-rosser-sentence\">92-df-rosser-sentence</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}rosser\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\land Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\land\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{RosserSent}_G(R)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\\bigl(G\\nvdash R\\land G\\nvdash\\neg R\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}rosser\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\land Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\land\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{RosserSent}_G(R)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\\bigl(G\\nvdash R\\land G\\nvdash\\neg R\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> : Rosser句子 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"9252d4105cc5f189\" href=\"?note=9252d4105cc5f189\" title=\"92-df-rosser-sentence\">92-df-rosser-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li>Rosser定理只需普通一致性（无需<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>一致性）</li>\n<li>“只需普通一致性”是相对于仍保留有效可公理化、正确证明算术化与足够算术强度而言，并不删除这些结构前提</li>\n<li>通过证明长度技巧实现</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>断言&quot;如果我有证明，则我的否定有更短证明&quot;</li>\n<li>这是Gödel原始证明的改进</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-rosser-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"9252d4105cc5f189","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-rosser-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-elementary-system","status":"resolved","id":"360e00ddf38f0f16","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-elementary-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"468d35690d25ee42","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-axiom-set","status":"resolved","id":"35c764f4e9f21f28","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-axiom-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G$ (system G, see [[92-df-g-system]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Con}(G)$ (consistency, see [[92-df-consistent]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-rosser-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"9252d4105cc5f189","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RosserSent}_G(R)$ (Rosser-sentence predicate, see [[92-df-rosser-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-rosser-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"9252d4105cc5f189","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$R$ : Rosser句子 (see [[92-df-rosser-sentence]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Elem}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RosserSent}_G(R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}rosser\\text{-}incompleteness}\\vdash\n\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Elem}(G)\\land Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\land\n\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{RosserSent}_G(R)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\\bigl(G\\nvdash R\\land G\\nvdash\\neg R\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false}],"bytes":1498,"backlinks":[{"id":"cd8dcab3ce41cbc6","anchor":"ref-23","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-rosser-incompleteness]] - Rosser定理"},{"id":"c1547d2395ecc99c","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-26","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-rosser-incompleteness]]"},{"id":"3402731b38b2c005","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-183","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-ce-incompleteness.md]]\n[[92-thm-ch-independence.md]]\n[[92-thm-compactness.md]]\n[[92-thm-completeness-fo.md]]\n[[92-thm-consistency-addable.md]]\n[[92-thm-consistency-strength-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-thm-craig-theorem.md]]\n[[92-thm-deduction-theorem.md]]\n[[92-thm-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[92-thm-essentially-undecidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-first-incompleteness.md]]\n[[92-thm-godel-incompleteness-general.md]]\n[[92-thm-godel-set-undecidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-halting-undecidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-incompleteness-recursive-extension.md]]\n[[92-thm-induction-axiom-decidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-k-g-equivalent.md]]\n[[92-thm-lob-theorem.md]]\n[[92-thm-m-complete-creative.md]]\n[[92-thm-numeral-injective.md]]\n[[92-thm-omega-incompleteness.md]]\n[[92-thm-pairing-bijective.md]]\n[[92-thm-pi1-incompleteness.md]]\n[[92-thm-pr-representable-detailed.md]]\n[[92-thm-pr-representable.md]]\n[[92-thm-reflection-undecidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-reflection-unprovable.md]]\n[[92-thm-representability.md]]\n[[92-thm-representation-strong.md]]\n[[92-thm-rice-theorem-arithmetic.md]]\n[[92-thm-rosser-incompleteness.md]]\n[[92-thm-schema-axiom-decidable.md]]\n[[92-thm-second-incompleteness.md]]\n[[92-thm-sigma1-completeness.md]]\n[[92-thm-simple-not-creative.md]]\n[[92-thm-sound-implies-consistent.md]]\n[[92-thm-substitution-representable.md]]\n[[92-thm-tarski-undefinability.md]]\n[[92-thm-truth-undefinable.md]]\n[[92-thm-turing-progress.md]]"}],"outgoing":["e0eabee5d77258a7","9252d4105cc5f189","c7befd96bd551ade","360e00ddf38f0f16","468d35690d25ee42","35c764f4e9f21f28"]}